            <h2>What is Ideogram?</h2>

            <p>Ideogram is an AI image generator launched in August 2023 by ex-Google Brain researchers. Its defining feature? <strong>Best-in-class text rendering.</strong> While Midjourney, DALL-E 3, and Stable Diffusion struggle with spelling and typography, Ideogram nails it consistently.</p>

            <p>It operates as a <strong>web app</strong> (no installation required) with a clean, intuitive interface. Type your prompt, specify any text you want in the image, and Ideogram generates 4 variations in ~20 seconds with correctly spelled, beautifully designed text.</p>

            <h3>Key Stats (2026):</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>5+ million users</strong> worldwide</li>
                <li><strong>Launched:</strong> August 2023, continuous improvements through 2024-2026</li>
                <li><strong>Interface:</strong> Web app (ideogram.ai), mobile-friendly</li>
                <li><strong>Pricing:</strong> FREE tier (100 images/day), Plus $8/mo, Pro $20/mo</li>
                <li><strong>Commercial use:</strong> Allowed on paid plans</li>
                <li><strong>Specialty:</strong> Text rendering, logos, posters, typography-heavy designs</li>
