                <li><strong>Remixing:</strong> Edit and regenerate variations of existing images</li>
                <li><strong>Negative prompts:</strong> Specify what NOT to include</li>
                <li><strong>Aspect ratio control:</strong> Square, portrait, landscape, and custom ratios</li>
