            <p>Ideogram's text rendering is <strong>revolutionary</strong>. It reliably generates:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Correct spelling:</strong> 95%+ accuracy vs 30-50% with other tools</li>
                <li><strong>Complex typography:</strong> Multiple text elements, fonts, sizes</li>
